TILE_SCHEMA: {"width": 64, "height": 64, "wrap_x": true, "wrap_y": true}; tile must be an object, never an array.
SYMMETRY_RULES: Exact D2 is required on pixel coordinates 0..63, centered at (31.5,31.5). For every off-axis mark, include the complete orbit under (x,y), (63-x,y), (x,63-y), and (63-x,63-y); include each distinct result once with identical shape, size, and colour. Transform every polygon/line vertex; swap rectangle width and height on quarter turns. Do not treat coordinate 32 as the tile center. 
